@startuml big-picture
title Keel in one picture:  your agent, with 5 safety guards around it

skinparam shadowing false
skinparam rectangle {
  BackgroundColor #FEFEFE
  BorderColor #555555
  roundCorner 15
}
skinparam ArrowColor #444444

rectangle "YOUR AI AGENT\n(LangGraph, or any loop)" as AGENT #LightYellow

rectangle "1. NEVER LOSE WORK\n(durable runtime)\n--\nCrashes? Resume where\nit stopped. No double\nemails or payments." as G1 #E8F5E9
rectangle "2. THE BOUNCER\n(MCP gateway)\n--\nChecks every tool call.\nGives a one-time pass\nthat expires fast." as G2 #E3F2FD
rectangle "3. PRIVACY SHIELD\n(PII proxy)\n--\nHides personal data\nbefore it reaches\nChatGPT / Claude." as G3 #F3E5F5
rectangle "4. EARLY WARNING\n(schema-drift guard)\n--\nSpots data-format\nchanges before they\nbreak your code." as G4 #FFF3E0
rectangle "5. CRASH-TEST DUMMY\n(chaos harness)\n--\nBreaks things on purpose\nto measure how well\nthe agent copes." as G5 #FFEBEE

AGENT -up- G1
AGENT -right- G2
AGENT -down- G3
AGENT -left- G4
AGENT -up- G5

legend bottom
  All 5 are separate tools that can be used alone,
  but they share one message bus (Kafka) so they
  work together as one platform.
endlegend
@enduml
